0 D royal stand / preparation bay. 4x8 spectator deck, two-layer 2x8 bench, 2-stud clear entry apron, blue single-pitch canopy, gold/red pennant, and an unroofed two-lance/two-shield side rack.
0 The 2335 pennant mounts the 87994 bar; 60897 thick vertical clips cradle the spare lance shafts. One seated minifigure checks nominal head clearance; standing entry remains open reference space; physical clutch/load remains unverified.
